"""
Fish-tank model export workflow.

This script trains the deployment candidates for the fish-tank soft sensors and
exports a compact, pruned, int16-quantized C/C++ header for Arduino deployment.
The generated header is intended to be included by the fish-node TinyML firmware.

Expected feature order in the generated header:
    input_raw[0] = DO_F(mg/L)
    input_raw[1] = ORP_F(mV)
    input_raw[2] = EC_F(mS/cm)
    input_raw[3] = pH_F
    input_raw[4] = Temp_F(C)
"""


